                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5112581d-894c-48c9-a576-a802a65bbe8f",
                                "sense_id": "6ae8db74-3064-3731-9720-a61f1acc0590",
                                "text": "\"Behufs der Glaubhaftmachung einer tatsächlichen Behauptung kann ein Beteiligter zur Versicherung an Eides statt zugelassen werden.\" (§ 15 II FGG)"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fb992fd1-8c90-47bf-a59c-d7bd8835d3c7",
                        "source_entry_id": "460333b0-8806-353c-b95a-2b34be4db67c",
                        "source_sense_id": "6ae8db74-3064-3731-9720-a61f1acc0590",
                        "source_sense_description": "Präposition mit Genitiv: zu dem Zweck",
                        "target_lang_word": "in order to",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "in order to",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0ea8d91a-53bf-3504-8314-d25b3c3aac9f",
                                        "entry_id": "1a60eb94-a462-36c4-aa18-87b3aeb248f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "before an infinitive: As a means of achieving the specified end; to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69d6634d-001e-43a1-b75f-47a69fd62f44",
                                                "sense_id": "0ea8d91a-53bf-3504-8314-d25b3c3aac9f",
                                                "text": "Here we were nearly 8 min. early, and was now a matter of spinning out time, as indeed we did—losing 3 min. from Penrith to Carlisle!—in order not to run into Carlisle more than 5 min. early."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3795bc1-f933-4808-9095-ee9a80441286",
                                                "sense_id": "0ea8d91a-53bf-3504-8314-d25b3c3aac9f",
                                                "text": "She stood in order to see over the crowd. / She stood to see over the crowd."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18d4e2b8-54b7-4a58-b514-a0c8205ee963",
                                                "sense_id": "0ea8d91a-53bf-3504-8314-d25b3c3aac9f",
                                                "text": "Simple common sense would dictate that the two-year schools, in order to compensate for the relative educational deprivation of their students, would have to spend more money on their college education."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa73ba35-264b-42c2-aa59-52f9bd3edb5f",
                                                "sense_id": "0ea8d91a-53bf-3504-8314-d25b3c3aac9f",
                                                "text": "In order to do that, I turn briefly to the ways in which the terms \"marked\" and \"unmarked\" are employed in other domains, to determine whether those notions can be extended naturally into the area of discourse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3682fa3e-5577-4097-825f-aa4b99072e8d",
                                                "sense_id": "0ea8d91a-53bf-3504-8314-d25b3c3aac9f",
                                                "text": "State law requires a name change applicant to publish notice of the potential name change, in order to alert the public in case anyone wants to contest the action."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0995e0bd-8ab5-4886-aaa0-e2cc25405f9e",
                        "source_entry_id": "460333b0-8806-353c-b95a-2b34be4db67c",
                        "source_sense_id": "6ae8db74-3064-3731-9720-a61f1acc0590",
                        "source_sense_description": "Präposition mit Genitiv: zu dem Zweck",
                        "target_lang_word": "in view of",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "in view of",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "93158366-5d0e-31b2-b06c-087a42797a7e",
                                        "entry_id": "e06d3bd7-1c32-3f24-99eb-7926d4fe6d8a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Considering."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e7bed58-a557-4045-83fc-65ac15782d9b",
                                                "sense_id": "93158366-5d0e-31b2-b06c-087a42797a7e",
                                                "text": "Mr. Thomas adds that, by the time it was scrapped, Kingsley was in very bad condition, little more than a shell in fact. In view of the rough usage to which the engine had been subjected, this is not surprising."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0560385-097e-4110-820c-36be21cd79fd",
                                                "sense_id": "93158366-5d0e-31b2-b06c-087a42797a7e",
                                                "text": "France, he said, was “almost a Bolshevik country”, in view of the “hidden scandals” such as that of the former Budget minister Jerome Cahuza"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e3c05ab6-0d86-3c5a-afdd-2969942f39dd",
                                        "entry_id": "e06d3bd7-1c32-3f24-99eb-7926d4fe6d8a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see in, view, of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "598f5558-c3c5-4364-94f0-bdf019d671c8",
                                                "sense_id": "e3c05ab6-0d86-3c5a-afdd-2969942f39dd",
                                                "text": "They stopped when they were in view of the town."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2e41c3c8-c5df-4d4b-a36c-4f7b0946bbd8",
                        "source_entry_id": "460333b0-8806-353c-b95a-2b34be4db67c",
                        "source_sense_id": "6ae8db74-3064-3731-9720-a61f1acc0590",
                        "source_sense_description": "Präposition mit Genitiv: zu dem Zweck",
                        "target_lang_word": "en vue de",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "en vue de",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bb18edc5-0abc-3d5f-b6c7-554999a0d751",
                                        "entry_id": "dfc9dc52-41bb-3c89-aab0-0fece6c3b4a4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En un point où l’on peut voir, d’où l’on peut être vu."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7efced69-6052-40ca-8d74-1f1555007722",
                                                "sense_id": "bb18edc5-0abc-3d5f-b6c7-554999a0d751",
                                                "text": "Le roi, accompagné d’Ivanhoé, de Gurth et de Wamba, arriva sans accident en vue du château de Coningsburg avant que le soleil eût quitté l’horizon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fea36963-27e6-3bb3-9d0e-c7d0c470d4e4",
                                        "entry_id": "dfc9dc52-41bb-3c89-aab0-0fece6c3b4a4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dans l’intention de, en considération de."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fecde4db-5106-469e-8286-f45251a91820",
                                                "sense_id": "fea36963-27e6-3bb3-9d0e-c7d0c470d4e4",
                                                "text": "[…] ; les utopies sociales furent faites en vue de maintenir un noyau de guerriers homériques dans les cités, etc."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a5b6ba2-fc70-4933-b9ac-e3ff8b67b8e3",
                                                "sense_id": "fea36963-27e6-3bb3-9d0e-c7d0c470d4e4",
                                                "text": "L’humidité donne de la souplesse et de l’élasticité aux fils, et c’est en vue de la facilité du travail que les filateurs maintiennent l’air de leurs salles de préparation et de métier à filer à un degré hygrométrique suffisant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba61d3c7-07e5-4f9b-ba61-a074b597fd88",
                                                "sense_id": "fea36963-27e6-3bb3-9d0e-c7d0c470d4e4",
                                                "text": "Les propriétaires riverains de cours d’eau non navigables ni flottables peuvent constituer une association syndicale en vue des travaux de mise en valeur piscicole de ces cours d’eau, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4b4c72f-5617-4cce-af04-8759f17d8b71",
                                                "sense_id": "fea36963-27e6-3bb3-9d0e-c7d0c470d4e4",
                                                "text": "Il avait appartenu, en qualité de porteur, à une troupe d’acrobates de cirque, puis s’était entraîné au tapis, en vue d’un numéro de « flic-flac » avec rattrape sur les épaules."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "505a8879-e34a-4ed0-ab8e-a8b9544f1495",
                                                "sense_id": "fea36963-27e6-3bb3-9d0e-c7d0c470d4e4",
                                                "text": "Il y avait le vieux soldat qui ne parlait que des Pachtouns et passait des heures à cirer ses bottes en vue de la bataille."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
